## 🧠 12. Quick Memory Trick

| Operator | Remember |
|---|---|
| `&` | Both must be 1 |
| `|` | At least one must be 1 |
| `^` | Different bits produce 1 |
| `~` | Flip every bit |

### Final Example

For `a = 5` and `b = 3`:

- `a & b` → `1`
- `a | b` → `7`
- `a ^ b` → `6`
- `~a` → `-6`

